  "front_corrections": [
    "Lid height is independently photo-fitted rather than equated to the published keyboard-base depth.",
    "Hinge Z datum shifts by the lid/base depth difference, keeping the closed front edges aligned.",
    "OLED size preserves native pixel-density-derived extent and aspect.",
    "Only upper OLED corners are rounded on modern notched MacBooks and Neo; lower corners remain square.",
    "Notch widths fit primary front artwork; high-density 4096-point sampling limits exported contour error.",
    "Screen frame uses lid-local center coordinates; opening stays within lid bounds.",
    "Legacy Air and 13-inch Pro have approximate sans-serif, finish-tinted bottom-bezel wordmarks; modern notched models omit them.",
    "Hinge shroud is recessed to avoid the closed lid; absorbing aperture barrels and machined planar socket faces avoid broad false reflections."
  ],
  "desktop_corrections": [
    "Top Apple mark preserves the source contour aspect.",
    "Physical recessed socket openings retain separate dark backs and connector tongues.",
    "Studio exhaust is a perforated aluminum sheet rather than generic vertical ribs.",
    "Legacy mini rear vent ribs use black material; compact mini has a recessed foot, radial intake and bottom power button."
